WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.943
Now we align the pandas dtypes more closely with the
concepts Sex becomes

00:00:05.969 --> 00:00:11.590
a categorical variable Triage level and membership
tier use ordered categorical

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:17.236
dtypes with the intended order written explicitly
Patient ID becomes

00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:22.915
a string because it identifies a record rather than
measuring an amount The

00:00:22.942 --> 00:00:27.679
dtype is now more informative but it still does not
replace documentation about the meaning

00:00:27.692 --> 00:00:28.665
of each variable
